        <div class="edge b"><span>01:07:30</span><span>01:07:40</span><span>01:07:50</span><span>01:08:10</span><span>01:09:10</span><span>01:09:30</span><span class="kept">01:09:40</span><span>01:09:50</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="legend">
      <span class="type"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3a9 9 0 1 1-.1 0"/></svg>kept, playback untouched</span>
      <span class="type"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 5l14 14M19 5L5 19"/></svg>passed over</span>
      <span class="type"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3v18" style="stroke-dasharray:3 3"/></svg>playhead on the television</span>
    </div>

    <div class="two" style="margin-top:clamp(40px,5vw,72px)">
      <div>
        <h3 style="font-size:1.5rem; margin-bottom:14px">Reach back without rewinding.</h3>
        <p class="measure">Some moments arrive before you are ready for them. A composition. A glance. A line that changes the scene. Open the Companion and move through the last two minutes until you find the frame that caught you. For a moment further away, jump across the full runtime. The film keeps playing. The moment is yours.</p>
        <p class="measure" style="margin-top:14px">No scramble for the remote. No photographing the screen. No asking everyone to wait while you find the frame again.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="phone-row">
